gpu-unlock-rh-40xx
Copyright (c) 2026 RH-RunningHub

This project provides deployment and hot-reboot tooling for unlocking the
tensor cores of RTX 4090 (10de:2684) / RTX 4090D (10de:2685) GPUs on Ubuntu,
based on the upstream gpu-unlock kernel module and firmware packages.

This repository itself ships no NVIDIA software: the DKMS module source and
the patched firmware are provided as separate packages by the upstream
gpu-unlock project and must be obtained independently (see README).

